{"final":{"answer":"The net change in Entergy Mississippi, Inc.'s net revenue during 2003 was an increase of $46.4 million (from $380.2 million in 2002 to $426.6 million in 2003).","value":46.4,"unit":"$ in millions","calculation":"2003 net revenue − 2002 net revenue = 426.6 − 380.2 = 46.4","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t4c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:1","checks":"Component check: base rates +48.3 and other −1.9 give 48.3 − 1.9 = 46.4, matching the year-over-year change."}}